California building codes
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project references the California Code of Regulations, Title 24, and the
model codes it adopts (including publications of the International Code
Council and the National Fire Protection Association). No code text is
distributed with this project: rule packs contain section citations and
structured, paraphrased requirements. PlanCheck is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the California Building Standards Commission, ICC, or NFPA, and
its findings are not a substitute for review by the authority having
jurisdiction or a licensed professional.
